[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" allows you to convert a formatted representation into a data type, using one of two approaches:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the data type by calling an initializer of that type that takes a formatted instance and a parse strategy as parameters. For example, you can create a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from a formatted string with the initializer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Decimal.init(_:format:lenient:)"},{"type":"text","text":" from the FoundationInternationalization module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a parse strategy and call its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/parse(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method on one or more formatted instances."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is closely related to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle","type":"reference"},{"text":", which provides the opposite conversion: from data type to formatted representation. To use a parse strategy, you create a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle","type":"reference"},{"text":" to define the representation you expect, then access the style’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"parseStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":" property to get a strategy instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example creates a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" format style (as provided by FoundationInternationalization) that uses US dollars and US English number-formatting conventions. It then creates a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" instance by providing a formatted string to parse and the format style’s `Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency.parseStrategy``.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let style = Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency(code: \"USD\",","locale: Locale(identifier: \"en_US\"))","let parsed = try? Decimal(\"$12,345.67\",","strategy: style.parseStrategy) \/\/ 12345.67"]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/ParseStrategy/ParseOutput":{"required":true,"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/ParseOutput","abstract":[{"text":"The output type returned by this strategy.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/parsestrategy\/parseoutput","title":"ParseOutput","fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ParseOutput","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/ParseStrategy/http-952ct":{"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date.HTTPFormatStyle"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/parsestrategy\/http-952ct","identifier":"doc:\/\